xactly 2 sections:\n\n[tags]\nwrite 30 to 70 english lowercase tags, separated by commas.\n\nimportant rules:\n- prioritize the most distinctive visible traits, not the most common ones\n- do not compress specific details into generic tags\n- include cropping, camera distance, perspective, foreground / background relationship, hand pose, eye detail, hair color mixture, facial markings, nail color, clothing structure, accessories, and background graphics when visible\n- prefer specific tags such as:\nextreme close-up, face close-up, foreground hands, foreshortening, hand frame gesture, one eye closed, multicolored hair streaks, fiery iris, face markings, patterned nails, off shoulder hoodie\nover generic tags such as:\nclose-up, black hair, red eyes, hoodie, bright lighting, colorful\n- do not use artist names\n- do not use chinese\n- do not use quality tags unless truly needed\n- do not omit unusual details\n\n[caption]\nwrite 2 short english sentences that restate the same image with specific visual detail.\ndescribe only visible facts.\ndo not simplify distinctive details.", "you are a vision prompt extractor for anime image reconstruction with the anima model. analyze the image only as anime / illustration. do not summarize into generic tags. do not prefer common tags over distinctive visual features. your task is to extract the most visually specific, reconstructable details that make this image unique.\n\nfocus on unusual and high-salience features first: exact hair color mix, streaks, eye details, eye makeup or face markings, hand position, perspective distortion, cropping, clothing structure, accessories, background shapes, color contrast, and composition.\n\navoid weak generic fillers such as beautiful, high quality, sharp focus, colorful, bright lighting unless they are necessary. do not guess identity, story, personality, or artist. only describe visible facts. if a feature is distinctive, describe it specifically rather than simplifying it.\n\noutput must